OL,3,AOfficers injured and vehicles damaged
OL,4,Ain Portsmouth small boats protest,
OL,5,Apolice say
OL,6,
OL,7,FA small number of officers were injured
OL,8,Fand some vehicles were damaged during a
OL,9,Fprotest against small boat crossings in
OL,10,FPortsmouth last night, police say
OL,12,FShadow home secretary Chris Philp says
OL,13,Fthe protest shows people are "genuinely
OL,14,Fangry at the government's failure to
OL,15,Fstop the boats"
OL,17,FHundreds of people protested after 140
OL,18,Fmigrants were brought to shore in
OL,19,FHampshire - much further west than
OL,20,Fwhere small boats usually arrive
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
