OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANew videos of man in 9/11 lawsuit
OL,4,Areveal extremist links
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man at the heart of a $1 trillion
OL,7,F(#733bn) lawsuit brought by 9/11
OL,8,Ffamilies had extensive links to Saudi
OL,9,Fgovernment officials and went
OL,10,Fpaintballing with one of al-Qaeda's
OL,11,Ffuture leaders, video obtained by the
OL,12,FBBC reveals.
OL,14,FThe footage, which the FBI had within
OL,15,Fdays of the 2001 attacks, stands in
OL,16,Fstark contrast to Omar al-Bayoumi's 25
OL,17,Fyears of denials that he was an
OL,18,Fextremist and a Saudi spy.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11913
SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1788788883
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANew videos of man in 9/11 lawsuit
OL,4,Areveal extremist links
OL,5,
OL,6,FBayoumi, who claimed to be a student
OL,7,Fwhen he was in the United States, is
OL,8,Fseen in one clip embracing Anwar
OL,9,Fal-Awlaki, who would go on to lead
OL,10,Fal-Qaeda in the Arabian Peninsula. In
OL,11,Fanother, Bayoumi and Awlaki are
OL,12,Fpaintballing near San Diego with an
OL,13,Fofficial from Saudi Arabia's Ministry
OL,14,Fof Islamic Affairs.
OL,16,FThe videos form part of the 9/11
OL,17,Ffamilies' lawsuit against Saudi Arabia
OL,18,Fand have never been shown publicly
OL,19,Fbefore.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
